      "Bring Brother Aldo soup bones from the gutter-hounds, and he will give you the cook's leaf he got from a Golden Cask man who drank in the Spoon.",
      "\"Bones. A soup without bones is hot water and hope.\" Brother Aldo taps the copper. \"The hounds you've been putting down. They've bones. Don't look at me like that. Everything in the Lowtowns is somebody's soup in the end.\"",
